    - target: {fileID: 3962917540685014439, guid: 67f4be0f82d90174ab4945173ce8636a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: I think something's amiss with this circus, can you go look around and
        find out what's causing this? I haven't seen anyone else around either, maybe
        they're petrified too?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3962917540685014439, guid: 67f4be0f82d90174ab4945173ce8636a, type: 3}
